WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.290
Picture a bull standing
firm on four strong legs.

2
00:00:04.340 --> 00:00:07.910
In Hindu tradition, this
bull stands for dharma.

3
00:00:07.960 --> 00:00:11.070
Age after age, the bull loses a leg.

4
00:00:11.120 --> 00:00:14.960
Many Hindus believe that
today it stands on just one.

5
00:00:15.010 --> 00:00:19.260
So what holds the world together,
and why is it wearing away?

6
00:00:19.310 --> 00:00:23.530
In this mission, you'll meet one word
that English needs half a dozen words to

7
00:00:23.580 --> 00:00:24.700
translate.

8
00:00:24.750 --> 00:00:29.310
Then you'll read a famous verse in which
Krishna promises to return whenever dharma

9
00:00:29.360 --> 00:00:30.610
declines.

10
00:00:30.660 --> 00:00:34.190
Your mission: find out
what Hindus mean by dharma,

11
00:00:34.240 --> 00:00:36.600
and why many say it is wearing away.
